msgstr "@rue_talk Y... cuando entremos a estos portales, seremos enviados a dicha ubicación..."
msgid "@proto2 [...Wherever that is.]"
msgstr "@proto2 [... Esté donde esté.]"
msgid "@rue I'm... sure \\p is already pretty familiar with retrieving puzzle pieces from this world on their computer."
msgstr "@rue Seguro que a \\p... no le cuesta recuperar piezas de puzle de este mundo en su ordenador."
msgid "@rue_talk ...But this time, \\p would need to move around some things, as well."
msgstr "@rue_talk ... Pero, esta vez, puede que \\p también tenga que mover ciertas cosas de sitio."
msgid "@cedric_talk ...specifically, by moving the keys from the small portal to the big one."
msgstr "@cedric_talk ... En concreto, mover las claves del portal pequeño al grande."
msgid "@cedric_hmm I... don't know what happens next, though."
msgstr "@cedric_hmm Aunque... no sé qué sucede luego."
msgid "@niko I see..."
msgstr "@niko Entiendo..."
msgid "@niko_speak Does \\p know where these portals lead, at least?"
msgstr "@niko_speak ¿\\p sabe al menos a dónde llevan estos portales?"
msgid "@rue You should probably ask \\p on this..."
msgstr "@rue Eso probablemente deberías preguntárselo a \\p..."
msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Right."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed Es verdad."
